        "original_id": "8c56fe72-7623-5569-83f9-8f95023c788d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Public Atorni: Asunto o Areglo, Judge Judy, The People's Court\n- Companies: TV5\n- Organizations: Public Attorney's Office\n- People: Judge Judy Sheindlin\n- Places: Philippines, United States, Manhattan\n- Topics: television court shows, mediation, small claims court, arbitration-based reality shows\n\nFacts:\n- Public Atorni: Asunto o Areglo is a Philippine television court show broadcast by TV5 in the Philippines.\n- Public Atorni: Asunto o Areglo features small claims court cases heard through mediation.\n- Public Atorni: Asunto o Areglo has a format similar to U.S. television court shows such as Judge Judy and The People's Court.\n- In Public Atorni: Asunto o Areglo, the chief of the Philippines' Public Attorney's Office serves as the mediator instead of a former judge.\n- Judge Judy is a long-running American arbitration-based reality court show.\n- Judge Judy is presided over by Judge Judy Sheindlin, who is a retired Manhattan family court judge.",
